WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A person uses a laptop at a desk. Their face is outlined green: primary user.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.500
Another person walks through the background. Their yellow face box indicates they do not pass the viewer checks.

00:09.500 --> 00:11.700
A person approaches behind the laptop user. Their face box is yellow.

00:11.700 --> 00:12.500
They turn toward the screen. Their face box turns red: viewer candidate.

00:12.500 --> 00:13.300
The demonstration closes Model view and resumes normal protection.

00:13.300 --> 00:18.000
The screen is blurred. A message reads: Screen Shield: someone may be viewing your screen.

00:18.000 --> 00:20.000
The viewer has left. After the absence delay, the workspace returns.
